# Greak: Memories of Azur (PPSA02849): cross the logo, the hand-drawn intro cutscene, the title
# screen's "PRESS X TO START", and the main menu into gameplay. Seconds are measured from the first
# pad poll. One-second Cross holds are poll-safe under slow software rendering (only a few pad polls
# per second). The title screen appears at roughly 112 s on a Linux hardware-Vulkan boot, after a long
# black post-cutscene load, so the presses start before that and repeat: Cross both advances the
# cutscene and confirms the title and the default main-menu entry.
